						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#883">GREAT JOB!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Well my brethrenites,we hath conquered wat we set out to do.Overrule The tower of Frozen Shadow.and all i have to say is .JOB WELL DONE.we all know the ending culdve been a little happiuer,but o well.tat all comes with the fun!it was a slow start,but at the end i think we really pulled together.That was the first of many more to come!Keep cheking the events page to see wat is comming up .thenks all for comming!<br />
<br />
Banta Frostpaw<br />
61st Warrior Extrodinaire<br />
Loyal Officer to The Lady Cythian.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							<br>
														<strong>By:</strong>
							<span class="name"> <a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=4617">Banta Frostpaw</a> at 2:17 AM PDT - August 18th, 2003</span>
						</td>
