			<p>
						<table width="95%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" class="border" border="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#881">Vendui Mortals!!</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Just want to put up a few notes and say welcome to a couple of new members. Welcome my old friend Wavewalker, a druid of unmatched skill (as proven when he dualed a rogue of equal seasons and handed her arse to her on a platter..well done!). We have have also brought into the fold Baredar, Joqun and Mork...we are honored to have you all!!<br />
  The face and needs of our guild are constantly changing.  There will continue to be an earnest search for good members that suit the requirements and needs of our family. Most of us come from other guilds and know how it can quickly grow into something other than the original blueprint.  We truly strive to keep ALL members involved and are working towards getting some type of &quot;gameplan&quot; together, other than just the typical &quot;let's go kill something&quot; attitude.  EQ offers so much more than that and we plan on exploiting that to it's fullest. Examples as of late include camping Umbral Plains so as to get Ashon fully geared..(damn greaves wont drop though...), a successful raid to obtain a major piece to Cythian's epic (GRATZ!!)...and the list goes on. If there is something that you need or simply would like to have, please let us know so that we might plan it.<br />
   Lastly, we do have some symbolance of an armory. Please check with Cythian to see if there is anything in the armory that might be an improvment to your gear. It is yours to wear/use until you get better at which time the item/s must be returned to the guild armory.<br />
<br />
Should change me name to Amends Longwind....<br />
<br />
Be safe Mortals!!!
						</td>
					</tr>
